  "details": "VRChat allows you to set your worlds to public and private. These work OK, but my problem with private worlds are that anyone with a link can join the world whenever they want. I think that adding a 3rd option such as \"unlisted\" will give world creators better options.\n\nPublic will work as it does now.\n\nUnlisted will work exactly how private works now. Allowing people to join with a link and host an instance in that world. They can set the instance to friends+, friends, invite+, and invite.\n\nPrivate will be changed to only allow the creator of the world to host instances. The creator can set the instance to friends+, friends, invite+, and invite.",
